      "content": "<h3>TreeMap versus HashMap versus LinkedHashMap versus ConcurrentSkipListMap</h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; width:100%;\">\n<tr><th style=\"text-align:left;\"></th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">TreeMap</th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">HashMap</th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">LinkedHashMap</th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">ConcurrentSkipListMap</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Order</td><td><strong>Sorted by key</strong></td><td>None</td><td>Insertion / access</td><td>Sorted by key</td></tr>\n<tr><td>get / put / remove</td><td>O(log n)</td><td>O(1)</td><td>O(1)</td><td>O(log n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Range / neighbour queries</td><td><strong>Yes</strong></td><td>No</td><td>No</td><td>Yes</td></tr>\n<tr><td>null key</td><td>No</td><td>One</td><td>One</td><td>No</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Thread-safe</td><td>No</td><td>No</td><td>No</td><td><strong>Yes</strong> (lock-free)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Key identity decided by</td><td>compareTo / Comparator</td><td>equals / hashCode</td><td>equals / hashCode</td><td>compareTo / Comparator</td></tr>\n</table>"
